# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Invite links look like doughmination.info/st/<code>. Forward them to the
# signup form with the code prefilled. Replaces the old server-side
# /st/[code] route, which can't be statically exported.
# The code is sanitised on submit in signup, so passing it raw is fine.
/st/*  /signup?code=:splat  302
